      <MissionDesc>THE CENTER FOR INTERNATIONAL POLICY IS A WOMAN-LED, PROGRESSIVE, INDEPENDENT NONPROFIT CENTER FOR RESEARCH, EDUCATION, AND ADVOCACY WORKING TO ADVANCE A MORE PEACEFUL, JUST, AND SUSTAINABLE U.S. APPROACH TO FOREIGN POLICY. THROUGH RESEARCH, CONVENING, AND STRATEGIC COMMUNICATIONS, WE PROVIDE NUANCED ANALYSES AND PROMOTE EVIDENCE-BASED POLICY SOLUTIONS TO ADDRESS TODAY'S MOST URGENT GLOBAL THREATS. CENTRAL TO OUR MISSION IS THE INCLUSION AND INTEGRATION OF DIVERSE PERSPECTIVES INTO OUR RESEARCH, WHICH CENTER THE VOICES OF COMMUNITIES MOST IMPACTED BY U.S. FOREIGN POLICY BOTH AT HOME AND ABROAD.</MissionDesc>
