        <Desc>GOVERNMENT AFFAIRS: THIS PROGRAM DEVELOPS AND MAINTAINS CONSTRUCTIVE PARTNERSHIPS WITH KEY GOVERNMENTAL OFFICIALS AS WELL AS OUTSIDE ORGANIZATIONS AND EXECUTES THE POLICY PRIORITIES OF CIP.</Desc>
      </ProgSrvcAccomActy3Grp>
